{"version":1,"content":"<p>一覺醒來，多個GPT賬號被封號了！OpenAI突然開啓大屠殺模式，沒有任何郵件通知，直接把賬號徹底刪除註銷。屏幕上只有一行報錯：「<strong>您的賬户已被刪除或停用</strong>（You do not have an account because it has been deleted or deactivated）」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585452.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.656972+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T08:09:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"f2e6edbb224bde4f86db2f1a8c2ee80ef721ded2aa0497d751a55ab7490488b5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}